{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、色々撮影しましたが\nまだ衣装見せられないので首上だけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさん、EX大衆さんのインタビュー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日、23日発売のUTBさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら見てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MステウルトラFES"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー曲を、ほぼ当時の歌唱メンバー・\n当時の衣装で披露させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、アンダーライブのリハーサルと\n舞台のお稽古、他にも色んなお仕事を\n両立しながら過ごしています。\n15th期間、アンダー選抜両方のスケジュールもこなしてたりして、体力的にはハードだけど\n毎日とっても楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"墓場女子高生、全国ツアーから間もない中でセリフも覚えて、\n既に一週間ほど前から台本を離して立ち稽古もしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出の丸さんが教えてくれることは、\n毎回とっても勉強になるし、\nすっごくすっごく身になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合唱部のお話なので、もちろん\nアイドルとは全然違った歌稽古もあり、\n新鮮で楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この稽古期間は過酷かもしれないけど、\n今の経験は絶対無駄にはならないと思うし、\n神様もきっと見ていてくれると思う！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、まいちゅん、万理華、純奈、あやねちゃん、あみ、日奈ちゃんには、\nいつも支えられてばかりです。\n結束力もすごく高まってて、皆がいるから頑張れてます。有難う。！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも千秋楽が終わったら、今練習してる\n合唱曲も、皆と舞台で歌えることは\n2度とないんだよなあ～\nと思うと、なんだか儚い...( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、がんばる！(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台本、こないだモバメで送ったものより\nさらにちゃんと製本してみた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の出るシーンと出ないシーンに分けて、\n本にした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋に豚しゅつげん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(いくちゃんは豚アレルギーの設定。)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から、広島・岡山・山口でアンダーライブ本番です。\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/09/21/6210761/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}